{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/7b15baac9b913d46a7c64278aa331183.avif?t=1757534168\" width=780 height=153 /></span>Every\u00a0turn\u00a0determines our survival.\u00a0In Mordfield Command, humanity\u2019s last hope is to outwit Algorithm Alpha \u2014 a ruthless AI determined to erase its creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending 4X strategy with wave-defense, you\u2019ll build fortified bases, manage scarce resources, and command tactical, turn-based battles across procedurally generated maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your defenses, endure the onslaught, and lead mankind\u2019s last stand against the machines. The ultimate goal: retake control \u2014 or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/508862bc3c49ac15499005eadf2c46cc.poster.avif?t=1757534168\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/508862bc3c49ac15499005eadf2c46cc.webm?t=1757534168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy grows stronger with every passing day. To survive, you\u2019ll need more than walls\u2014you\u2019ll need to adapt. Reassess your tactics, launch decisive counterattacks, and endure the escalating onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/53f96d3df1b67f4aceb999379d7ea895.poster.avif?t=1757534168\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/53f96d3df1b67f4aceb999379d7ea895.webm?t=1757534168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce \u2014 and every scrap is contested. Strategically reclaim vital materials to expand your reach and fuel your war effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving tech tree unlocks powerful defenses and devastating countermeasures, giving you the edge in a war of attrition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike back by targeting enemy outposts and command centers \u2014 shut down their reinforcements before they overwhelm you, and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/df69af0279c6ad3e16b7bc39d0482caf.poster.avif?t=1757534168\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/df69af0279c6ad3e16b7bc39d0482caf.webm?t=1757534168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the bold and the fearless can lead our fight against systematic annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/e9db6b8531727651e12749ce0d4e737a.avif?t=1757534168\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Every second counts. Enable 15 or 30 second turns and make critical decisions under pressure, where hesitation could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Units grow stronger through survival. Deploy squads carefully to create elite fighters capable of turning the tide in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat. Damaged areas become harder to traverse, forcing you to adapt your strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Forge your own battlefields and unique missions. Share creations with the community and test your strategies in PvP showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Customize maps, round lengths, and battlefield types to assert your dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield. No two playthroughs are alike, keeping strategies fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points wisely to maximize tactical options each turn. Every choice can make the difference between survival and annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unmatched Replayability</strong> \u2014 Multiple resources, diverse combat units, varied biomes, and an expanding technology tree combine with procedural generation to ensure new challenges every time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1757534168","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1757534168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/7ca5f3432a32a969a0c329285f62aa2bc3601fce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757534168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/7ca5f3432a32a969a0c329285f62aa2bc3601fce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757534168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descript